/apps/3540570/extras/3c098ed23f6f89387adbd4c1ede082fe.webm?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/3c098ed23f6f89387adbd4c1ede082fe.mp4?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once in a while, a<strong> Forge Pod</strong>\u00a0will drop nearby, letting you craft <strong>Weapon Mods</strong> and <strong>Haz-Pro</strong> items. But to craft what you need, explore the different biomes and gather enough resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 3 different weapon mod categories: <i>Propulsion</i>, <i>Impact</i> and <i>Prototype</i>. Experiment with what each mod does and find the best combo that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haz-Pro items are crafted in a similar manner, but is essential for making biome traversal easier. Craft the matching Haz-Pro item for the biome you want to explore and be on your merry way for even more crafting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Survival Kit</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/b52c127543c2add33c1f53cf2abd50d8.poster.avif?t=1773149824\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/b52c127543c2add33c1f53cf2abd50d8.webm?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/b52c127543c2add33c1f53cf2abd50d8.mp4?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating the evil robot minions will grant you with <strong>Scrap Metal</strong>. But they also have a chance to drop some <strong>Fine Metal</strong>. Use this resource to craft <i>quick-use items</i> from your <i>Survival Kit</i> to escape tight situations or give you an advantage in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Power Cores</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/5d514d101ca59ee98c15b1df3dcdadc6.poster.avif?t=1773149824\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/5d514d101ca59ee98c15b1df3dcdadc6.webm?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/5d514d101ca59ee98c15b1df3dcdadc6.mp4?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fuse various core fragments dropped by enemies to create unique power cores with combined effects. One weapon, hundreds of combinations. Try them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Tactical Skills</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor has multiple tactical skills, ultimate abilities and their primary weapons are all equipped with overcharge abilities. Use the ones that fit your playstyle and survive the oncoming robot hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Level-Up Systems</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character levels up in-run by collecting experience orbs. Choose from Strength, Vitality, Agility and several sub-categories in them to maximize your character's survivability. Perform well in-run to permanently level up your characters, weapons and armor modules to have a better chance at getting to that 'Life Essence'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Helper Gadgets</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring up to 2 gadgets to swap between in-run to aid you with tedious tasks like finding resources, collecting resources, or to heal yourself or simply have extra fire-support! Level them up alongside you and maximize their effectiveness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Preset Loadouts</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/bcbdee2a5d61ab2f3abfa8807147a1e3.poster.avif?t=1773149824\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/bcbdee2a5d61ab2f3abfa8807147a1e3.webm?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/extras/bcbdee2a5d61ab2f3abfa8807147a1e3.mp4?t=1773149824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Survivesmith, you don't have to submit to the randomness of the upgrades you get. While there are many random elements to experience in the game, your loadout isn't one of them. Make sure you know what you're doing, and equip well before a round!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, adapt, and unleash absolute firepower in <i>Survivesmith</i>. Discover hidden weapon secrets, master your loadout, and forge your own path to the ultimate prize\u2014the Life Essence. Do you have what it takes to outlast the human-made machine hordes and the unforgiving nature to save humanity?</p>","developers":["Stardust-Forge Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540570/a113aee57624e19451cb15be385866a2b9c535a8/header.jpg?t=1773149824","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3540570/627998945/34ce1f93c821693d25f9976ac560e7da6fa2e600/1772686045/dash_av1.mpd?